abstract: >-
  Software for verifying and reproducing the frozen patient-level external
  stimulation-response correspondence analysis from released derived features.
  The software license is Apache-2.0; checkpoint and data terms are described
  separately in DATA_AND_WEIGHTS_NOTICE.md. Adam-Bai identifies the repository
  maintainer, not the manuscript author list. No archive DOI has been assigned
  in this metadata.
keywords:
  - intracranial stimulation
  - patient-specific response mapping
  - reproducibility
